# ---- ML artifacts ----
# Weights and indexes are excluded by default: they are large and derived.
#
# ⚠️ EXCEPT the two artefacts the deployed container must contain. Render/Railway
# build the image from this repository, and there is nowhere else for the
# container to obtain a locally-trained model. The negations below are what make
# `docker build` able to bake them in — remove them and production starts with no
# model and no assistant index.
#
# Sizes: efficientnet_b0_agri.pt ~16 MB, knowledge_base.faiss ~950 KB.
# If the weights grow past a few tens of MB, move them to Git LFS or object
# storage and download them in the Dockerfile instead.
*.pt
*.pth
*.onnx
*.faiss
*.index
artifacts/
models/weights/
backend/app/rag/index/
data/raw/
data/processed/

# The deployment artefacts — see the note above before changing these.
!backend/app/models/weights/
!backend/app/models/weights/efficientnet_b0_agri.pt
!backend/app/rag/index/
!backend/app/rag/index/knowledge_base.faiss
!backend/app/rag/index/knowledge_base.meta.json
!backend/app/rag/index/.gitkeep

